faultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"660568ea","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"html":"<blockquote style=\"font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-style:italic;color:#031830;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;padding-left:16px;border-left:2px solid #BDDAE8;\">&ldquo;La adicci&oacute;n tiene un origen. Puede ser emocional, relacional o ligado a la historia personal de cada uno.&rdquo;<\/blockquote>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"-16","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"1b1422ea","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter,sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #4a5a6a; margin-bottom: 12px;\">En Emerae empezamos por entender <b>qu\u00e9 funci\u00f3n ha cumplido la adicci\u00f3n en la vida de esa persona.<\/b> Su patr\u00f3n de consumo, su contexto emocional, lo que hay detr\u00e1s.<\/p><p style=\"font-family: Inter,sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #4a5a6a;\">Porque dejar de consumir es solo el primer paso. Lo que sostiene el cambio es entender por qu\u00e9 se empez\u00f3 \u2014 y construir desde ah\u00ed.<\/p>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"734231c8","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"text":"Ver c\u00f3mo trabajamos \u2192","link":{"url":"#tratamiento"},"background_color":"transparent","button_text_color":"#031830","border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"1","right":"1","bottom":"1","left":"1","isLinked":true},"border_color":"rgba(7,33,61,0.2)","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"100","right":"100","bottom":"100","left":"100","isLinked":true},"typography_font_family":"Inter","typography_font_size":{"unit":"rem","size":0.81999999999999995},"typography_font_weight":"500","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"28","bottom":"14","left":"28","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"button","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"41702579","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:36px;\"><div style=\"background:#f7f8f9;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#BDDAE8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1rem;\">&#128269;<\/div><div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin-bottom:6px;\">Trabajamos el origen, no solo la conducta<\/div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;\">Porque dejar de consumir es la parte m&aacute;s f&aacute;cil. Lo que marca la diferencia es entender qu&eacute; funci&oacute;n ha cumplido la adicci&oacute;n en tu vida &mdash; y trabajar desde ah&iacute;.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background:#f7f8f9;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#BDDAE8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1rem;\">&#129309;<\/div><div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin-bottom:6px;\">Est&aacute;s acompa&ntilde;ado desde el primer d&iacute;a<\/div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;\">No tienes que llegar con todo claro ni con fuerzas. Llegas como est&aacute;s, y desde ah&iacute; construimos juntos. Hay personas reales al otro lado, que conocen tu caso y est&aacute;n presentes en cada fase.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background:#f7f8f9;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#BDDAE8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1rem;\">&#129504;<\/div><div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin-bottom:6px;\">Rigor cl&iacute;nico, trato cercano<\/div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;\">Trabajamos con metodolog&iacute;as que tienen evidencia cient&iacute;fica &mdash; TCC, EMDR, regulaci&oacute;n emocional. Pero lo que gu&iacute;a cada decisi&oacute;n no es el protocolo, sino la persona que tenemos delante.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout","panel":{"activeTab":"layout","activeSection":"section_layout"}}}],"page_settings":{"template":"default"},"version":"0.4","title":"3.ENFOQUE_EMERAE","type":"section"}